        "Content": "- Substantial 5/6-bedroom semi-detached family home with generous, versatile accommodation extending over three levels.\r\n- Exceptional living space, including multiple reception rooms, spacious kitchen/breakfast room, large dining room and separate utility and storage areas.\r\n- Five generous bedrooms upstairs all with built-in wardrobes throughout and master bedroom en-suite.\r\n- Partially converted attic providing a finished attic room, plus a large additional storage area, offering excellent potential for further conversion.\r\n- Particularly spacious rear garden with lawn, patio, a second large entertaining area which is decked. Excellent space for family life and outdoor entertaining.\r\n- Quiet, highly sought-after Canterbrook location, within walking distance of Navan town centre and close to schools, shops, sports and leisure facilities.\r\n- Ideal commuter location, with easy access to the M3 and R147 without passing through town, and convenient transport links to Dublin.\r\n- T&G floors throughout upstairs under floor coverings.             \r\n- PVC double glazed windows. PVC fascia, soffits & gutters.\r\n- Wired for alarm. Built c. 2000 and extended in 2008."
